00:00:00,048 --> 00:00:02,917
So we have a spec.md file for this project

2
00:00:02,917 --> 00:00:05,834
here, and this spec.md file will be one

3
00:00:05,963 --> 00:00:10,211
important piece of context we sometimes may

4
00:00:10,227 --> 00:00:13,753
need for our prompts we send to Codex. Now,

5
00:00:13,817 --> 00:00:17,232
this spec.md file here will not be included

6
00:00:17,264 --> 00:00:20,149
by default into our Codex prompts though. So

7
00:00:20,149 --> 00:00:21,961
if we want to send a prompt like this to

8
00:00:21,977 --> 00:00:25,071
Codex, it may not be aware of our spec. Now,

9
00:00:25,263 --> 00:00:27,876
chances actually are that it will find this

10
00:00:27,908 --> 00:00:30,008
spec.md file though, because this is a

