will matter to the model for a certain task,

32
00:01:26,544 --> 00:01:29,384
don't hope that it will find it no matter

33
00:01:29,384 --> 00:01:32,035
how likely that is. Instead, make sure to

34
00:01:32,035 --> 00:01:32,883
include it. Good prompt and context

35
00:01:32,883 --> 00:01:33,568
engineering is about providing

36
00:01:35,570 --> 00:01:37,272
providing the right context and if you know

37
00:01:37,288 --> 00:01:39,425
that something matters, include it in your

38
00:01:39,521 --> 00:01:42,734
context like a pointer at this spec.md file

39
00:01:42,734 --> 00:01:42,863
here.

40
00:01:43,457 --> 00:01:45,305
And of course, we could also do this as a

41
00:01:45,305 --> 00:01:47,666
follow-up task here in the native app

